[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0901","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0901.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0756","title":"Microsoft Outlook 98/2000 vCard 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Outlook 98 及 2000 在处理 vCard (.vcf) 电子名片文件时，未能正确校验并处理过长或格式错误的字段，导致解析逻辑出现异常。远程攻击者可以通过诱导用户打开一个经过精心构造的恶意 vCard 文件，触发该漏洞，从而导致 Outlook 客户端程序崩溃并引发拒绝服务（DoS）状态。该漏洞主要影响 Outlook 98 和 2000 版本，攻击者无需通过身份验证即可利用此漏洞影响目标系统的可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0756"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:24Z","remediation":"建议将 Microsoft Outlook 98/2000 升级至 Outlook 2002 或更高版本；若必须维持原版本，请安装微软官方发布的 vCard 解析安全更新补丁，或在打开来源不明的 .vcf 电子名片文件前进行严格的格式检查以避免触发拒绝服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1633","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Springmail.105.967737080.0.16997300%40www.springmail.com","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0756.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0756.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0756","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0756.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0756.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/785d709d514558e172acbeb4efdb10760478ab87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0756.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1e9aa0e87d4eb1e9f99e0f5b9c02665ba8ee98ef/2000/CVE-2000-0756.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f4cffac67804f46d22292c2f69fa529dc186f5dd/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0756.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0756.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0756.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0901.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0898","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0898.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0755","title":"HP HP-UX newgrp 命令本地权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 11.00 系统中的 newgrp 命令存在权限提升漏洞。该漏洞的原理在于 newgrp 命令在处理组切换逻辑时未能正确验证用户权限，导致本地攻击者可以通过执行该命令触发权限管理缺陷，从而在目标系统上获取特权账户权限。此漏洞影响范围仅限拥有本地账户访问权限的用户，攻击条件为本地登录，通过特定参数调用 newgrp 即可实现权限提升，对系统安全性构成威胁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0755"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:24Z","remediation":"建议将 HP-UX 11.00 系统升级至最新的补丁版本，或安装由 HP 发布的针对 newgrp 命令的安全修复补丁。对于无法立即升级的系统，可以通过修改文件权限或使用 sudo 策略限制普通用户调用 newgrp 命令，以消除本地权限提升风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0144.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1581","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0755.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0755.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0755","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0755.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0755.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/785d709d514558e172acbeb4efdb10760478ab87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0755.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1bef2e52aefa913c1ba8a70b611847a08b1e7b81/2000/CVE-2000-0755.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f4cffac67804f46d22292c2f69fa529dc186f5dd/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0755.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0755.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0755.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0898.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0897","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0897.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0754","title":"HP OpenView Network Node Manager (NMM) 密码加密漏洞","description":"HP OpenView Network Node Manager (NMM) 6.1 版本存在密码加密漏洞。该漏洞源于密码加密保护机制不足，攻击者在本地系统中无需身份认证即可利用，通过低复杂度操作获取或篡改网络节点管理器存储的密码敏感信息。成功利用可导致密码数据泄露或系统完整性受损。该漏洞影响部署 HP OpenView NMM 6.1 的系统环境。建议升级至受支持的软件版本，并实施严格的本地访问控制策略以缓解风险。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0754"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:24Z","remediation":"建议将 HP OpenView Network Node Manager 6.1 升级至 6.2 或更高版本以修复密码加密漏洞（CVE-2000-0754）。如暂无法升级，应在操作系统层面通过访问控制列表限制仅有授权用户可访问 NNM 服务端口，或临时部署防火墙规则限制对 NNM 管理接口的本地及远程访问权限，并强制重置所有管理账户密码以降低信息泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0144.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1581","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0754.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/13b4b6847c146245cb34369c97e37afd6dfad908/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0754.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0754","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0754.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0754.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/785d709d514558e172acbeb4efdb10760478ab87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0754.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1678061d20f9336914de78aef7c69168db2a7f8c/2000/CVE-2000-0754.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f4cffac67804f46d22292c2f69fa529dc186f5dd/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0754.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0754.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0754.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0897.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0896","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0896.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0753","title":"Microsoft Outlook 物理路径信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Outlook 邮件客户端在处理富文本格式（RTF）文件的 winmail.dat 附件时存在信息泄露漏洞。由于程序在解析该附件时未能对发送端路径进行脱敏处理，导致发送者机器的物理路径被包含在附件中。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送包含特制 winmail.dat 附件的邮件，诱导目标用户打开，从而获取发送端的系统文件路径信息。该漏洞影响早期的 Outlook 版本，可被用于辅助侦察发送方的系统环境，进而提升后续攻击的精准度。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0753"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:24Z","remediation":"建议将 Microsoft Outlook 升级至 2002 及以上版本。对于无法升级的极旧版本，可通过在邮件设置中禁用“富文本格式 (RTF)”附件的自动解析，或在企业网关层面过滤包含 winmail.dat 附件的异常邮件以降低信息泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/201422","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/78240","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1631","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5508","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e7eb023b782298741349c34d7e1f5ea1ecb3d73d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0753.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/13b4b6847c146245cb34369c97e37afd6dfad908/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0753.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0753","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0753.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0753.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7330b0580e3b5cfcde14ca2a28aa1774cbe1d7d1/2000/CVE-2000-0753.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/42f7ce3fe01d1b8b4a37ed409361811a74eb1f5b/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0753.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f4cffac67804f46d22292c2f69fa529dc186f5dd/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0753.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0753.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0753.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0896.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0895","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0895.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0752","title":"FreeBSD brouted 本地缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 及其部分其他操作系统的 brouted 路由守护进程存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞源于程序在处理命令行参数时缺乏严格的长度校验，当本地用户通过命令行传递超长参数时，会触发内存缓冲区溢出。攻击者可利用此缺陷覆盖栈帧中的返回地址，从而在特权上下文中执行任意代码，最终获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响部署了 brouted 服务的 FreeBSD 及相关兼容系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0752"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:24Z","remediation":"建议立即更新 FreeBSD 系统至已修复该漏洞的最新补丁版本，或在不需要桥接路由功能时禁用并卸载 routed/brouted 服务。对于无法立即更新的旧系统，应通过严格限制对该二进制文件的执行权限（如 chmod 700）来防止普通本地用户调用该程序，从而缓解漏洞被利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-08/0339.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1629","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e7eb023b782298741349c34d7e1f5ea1ecb3d73d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0752.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/13b4b6847c146245cb34369c97e37afd6dfad908/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0752.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0752","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0752.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0752.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7330b0580e3b5cfcde14ca2a28aa1774cbe1d7d1/2000/CVE-2000-0752.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f4cffac67804f46d22292c2f69fa529dc186f5dd/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0752.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/42f7ce3fe01d1b8b4a37ed409361811a74eb1f5b/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0752.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0752.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0752.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0895.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0894","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0894.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0749","title":"FreeBSD Linux二进制兼容模块 缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"tags.\n\nThe description needs to be inside the TOML as a multi-line string. Looking at the current TOML, the description field uses triple quotes `\"\"\"` for multi-line.\n\nLet me write a comprehensive description:\n\n\"FreeBSD 系统中 Linux 二进制兼容性模块存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当处理 Linux 影子文件系统（shadow file system）中的长文件名时，模块未能正确校验输入字符串长度，导致固定大小的缓冲区溢出。本地低权限用户可利用此漏洞，通过在受影响的兼容性路径下创建包含超长文件名的文件，触发缓冲区溢出，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 3.x 至 5.x 版本。攻击条件为本地访问，无需身份认证，利用门槛较低，属于高危本地权限提升漏洞。\"\n\nLet me count: that's well over 50 characters. It covers:\n- 漏洞原理: 缓冲区溢出，未能正确校验输入字符串长度\n- 影响范围: FreeBSD 3.x 至 5.x 版本\n- 攻击条件: 本地访问，无需身份认证\n- 利用方式: 通过长文件名触发\n\nNow I need to output only the <value>...\n","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0749"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:24Z","remediation":"立即升级 FreeBSD 至 3.5-STABLE（2000-08-24 后）、4.1-STABLE（2000-07-29 后）或 5.0-CURRENT（2000-07-23 后）版本，或从 ftp://ftp.freebsd.org/pub/FreeBSD/CERT/patches/SA-00:42/linux.patch 获取补丁并重新编译内核。若无法立即升级，可执行 kldunload linux 卸载 linux 内核模块，删除 /modules/linux.ko 文件，并在 /etc/rc.conf 中设置 linux_enable=\"NO\" 以禁用 Linux 二进制兼容模块，防止本地用户通过长文件名利用缓冲区溢出获取 root 权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-08/0338.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1536","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1628","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5968","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab00a662168d29727ed07327ed7248857f064d23/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0749.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0749","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e52b937328f58a3e9a1e7e8e4c1ac9025c3099d3/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0749.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a8ff0f0688217475a7ba2a404f9887907cad5560/2000/CVE-2000-0749.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0749.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0749.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/537c626a629083369daa568372a12317339c7514/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0749.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b01d01b655cac08088621898fd70278524e2f0e/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0749.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0749.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0749.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0894.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0893","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0893.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0748","title":"OpenLDAP ud 二进制文件权限提升漏洞","description":"OpenLDAP 1.2.11 及更早版本在安装时对 `ud` 二进制文件的权限配置不当，错误地将其设置为组可写。这意味着属于该组的任何本地用户都可以用木马程序替换该二进制文件。当系统或高权限用户随后以提升权限执行被替换的 `ud` 时，攻击者即可借此实现权限提升或任意代码执行。该漏洞主要影响安装了上述版本 OpenLDAP 的系统，攻击前提是攻击者已经拥有目标主机上的本地用户账号并属于 `ud` 所属组的成员。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0748"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:23Z","remediation":"立即将 OpenLDAP 升级至 1.2.12 或更高版本，该版本修复了 ud 二进制文件的组写权限问题；升级前可通过执行 chmod g-w /usr/libexec/openldap/ud （路径视安装位置而定）去除组写权限作为临时缓解","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0375.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1511","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab00a662168d29727ed07327ed7248857f064d23/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0748.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e52b937328f58a3e9a1e7e8e4c1ac9025c3099d3/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0748.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0748","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0748.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d204edeccdebd5010352130572fc295de37005f2/2000/CVE-2000-0748.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0748.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/de5e978a48281a824409de119a9380c20aa11e39/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0748.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b01d01b655cac08088621898fd70278524e2f0e/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0748.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0748.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0748.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0893.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0892","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0892.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0800","title":"SUSE knfsd rpc.kstatd 权限提升漏洞","description":"SuSE linuxnfs/knfsd 包中的 rpc.kstatd 服务存在字符串解析错误漏洞，远程未授权攻击者可通过发送特制的 RPC 请求触发缓冲区溢出或格式化字符串漏洞，进而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 SuSE Linux 及其他使用 knfsd 包的 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 10.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），属于最高危级别。攻击者无需任何身份认证即可远程利用，直接获取系统最高权限，建议立即升级至修复版本或禁用 rpc.kstatd 服务。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0800"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:30Z","remediation":"立即升级到SuSE Linux Enterprise Server的7.0 SP3或更高版本，该版本修复了rpc.kstatd中的字符串解析漏洞。升级后确保使用root用户启动kstatd服务，并通过修改/etc/nfs/kstatd.conf文件禁用不安全的远程访问功能。如无法立即升级，可临时在防火墙上阻止源端口111的入站流量以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_58.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/285830d3bc68381daeff2169c3b0a4500df03b19/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0800.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dd1c73c7d44a762cc5a69d15ad07fe20976d7aec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0800.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0800","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0800.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0800.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/94607cd5f476edf9a266e633e1be7e43ab890e1c/2000/CVE-2000-0800.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0800.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e60bb3a306b43cc668d535cff411b9566d5ecc1b/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0800.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0800.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0800.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0892.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0891","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0891.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0750","title":"NetBSD mopd 缓冲区溢出远程命令执行漏洞","description":"NetBSD 操作系统中 mopd（Maintenance Operations Protocol 加载守护进程）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含过长文件名的特制网络请求，触发该缓冲区溢出，从而执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响运行 mopd 服务的 NetBSD 系统版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可在远程利用此漏洞获取系统控制权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0750"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:24Z","remediation":"升级 NetBSD 至 1.4.2 或更高版本，或从 NetBSD CVS 获取 mopd/process.c r1.8 修订版本的补丁并重新编译安装 mopd。OpenBSD 用户请应用 2.7 的第 018 号安全补丁（018_mopd.patch），FreeBSD 用户请安装 FreeBSD-SA-00:40 安全公告中的修复包，Red Hat Linux 用户请安装 RHSA-2000:050 安全更新。如暂无法升级，可在防火墙或路由器层面阻断 UDP 端口 652 和 653 的 MOP 协议流量，或直接从 inetd.conf 中禁用 mopd 服务行以临时缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0064.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-08/0336.html","http://cvsweb.netbsd.org/bsdweb.cgi/basesrc/usr.sbin/mopd/mopd/process.c.diff?r1=1.7&r2=1.8&f=h","http://www.openbsd.org/errata.html#mopd","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-050.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1558","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0da25b98d7bcc33832f1568bdeed8ba3a55a37d8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0750.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0750","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/12510680d47d531059ad635931375e3cc99ef556/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0750.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0750.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/82fa4d34edb87bea922e17f8a348577c5a814079/2000/CVE-2000-0750.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0750.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f4cffac67804f46d22292c2f69fa529dc186f5dd/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0750.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/42f7ce3fe01d1b8b4a37ed409361811a74eb1f5b/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0750.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0750.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1811750a5b6a37290aff484954f5ab77b0ca64a7/content/CVE-2000-0750.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0891.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0890","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0890.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0744","title":"University of Minnesota gopherd 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"该候选编号已被 CVE 官方拒绝并标记为重复，应参考 CVE-2000-0743。实际漏洞为明尼苏达大学开发的 Gopher 守护进程 gopherd 2.x 版本存在缓冲区溢出缺陷，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标发送包含超长票证值的 DES 密钥生成请求（GDESkey）触发溢出，进而在目标服务器上执行任意系统命令。该漏洞广泛影响部署了 gopherd 2.x 的 Unix 及 Linux 系统，攻击成功后可完全控制目标主机，危害极其严重。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0744"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:55:23Z","remediation":"该漏洞编号已被官方弃用，系 CVE-2000-0743 的重复项。请直接参考 CVE-2000-0743 的修复建议，执行相应的软件更新或配置加固操作，无需针对此编号单独处理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/231116aa5795023b4be954f9aed84939e97cf046/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0744.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/15f9f7a0b2cc2a296dac75e46487bfa653db3e1b/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0744.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0744.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0744","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0744.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b01d01b655cac08088621898fd70278524e2f0e/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0744.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/850a5c12479fcc3145fda9fa79403efdef7fb609/2000/CVE-2000-0744.json","https://github.com/justakazh/CVE_Database/blob/06bd07f32c89b43f30d59ff450dfbb661e471cbe/2000/CVE-2000-0744.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/63bc6ccb7d9e7d0447e23eb842c0b23beddd261c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0744.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/a61093fe8784b8ca7275942dc1f03ea5da66b812/api/2000/CVE-2000-0744.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0890.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0889","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0889.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0742","title":"Microsoft Windows 95/98 IPX 协议拒绝服务漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于 Microsoft Windows 95 和 Windows 98 的 IPX 协议实现中。由于系统在处理特定 IPX 格式的数据包时缺乏足够的校验，远程攻击者可以通过向目标系统发送一个源地址为广播地址的特制 IPX Ping 数据包（即畸形 IPX Ping 包）来触发此漏洞。攻击者无需通过身份验证即可在网络层实施攻击，这将导致目标系统崩溃或服务不可用，造成拒绝服务（DoS）影响。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0742"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:23Z","remediation":"建议禁用 Windows 95/98 系统中的 IPX/SPX 协议栈以消除攻击面。具体操作为：进入“控制面板”→“网络”→“协议”选项卡，选中“IPX/SPX 协议”并将其删除。对于必须使用该协议的旧环境，建议升级至 Windows 2000 或更高版本操作系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","referenc