意邮件即可触发拒绝服务，影响可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0736"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:22Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Becky! Internet Mail 客户端至 1.26.05 或更高版本（官网 https://www.rimarts.co.jp/software/becky/ 下载最新版）。若暂时无法升级，建议配置邮件客户端禁止自动转发带有异常长 Content-Type 头的邮件，或在邮件网关层面拦截 Content-Type 头超长的 MIME 消息作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0234.html","http://member.nifty.ne.jp/rimarts/becky-e/Readme.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1588","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b3c35d89abde60a88f7cb8e626161de34dd6ab36/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0736.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bcbdb8ae7a9ef1c1e1ea2320e0a3f339a967446e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0736.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0736","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0736.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0736.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0e284be0197bae1df3d577d9f9f2155925bb6629/2000/CVE-2000-0736.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/8a3e2d14c2e04b1bff1df5344192e8356dcd6b1d/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0736.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1b97942de7f8736fb9dac77c314951b8b2cd2867/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0736.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0736.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0736.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0886.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0885","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0885.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0735","title":"Becky! Internet Mail 邮件客户端 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Becky! Internet Mail 客户端在处理邮件回复时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可向目标系统发送包含超长 Content-Type: MIME 头部的恶意邮件。当用户回复受感染邮件时，邮件客户端会在处理大量数据时导致内存缓冲区溢出，进而触发程序崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Becky! Internet Mail 客户端 1.26.03 及更早版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用这一漏洞，导致应用程序无法正常运行。漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级为中级。尽管这是一个拒绝服务漏洞，但在特定环境下，攻击者可能结合其他技术实现代码执行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0735"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:22Z","remediation":"立即升级 Becky! Internet Mail 客户端到 1.26.04 或更高版本，从中获取修复缓冲区溢漏洞的补丁。如无法立即更新，可通过邮件客户端设置禁用 MHTML 格式回复功能，或在系统中启用邮件内容长度限制和 MIME 头检测，防止过长内容类型触发溢出。(≥20字)","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0234.html","http://member.nifty.ne.jp/rimarts/becky-e/Readme.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1588","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0735.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0735.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0735","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0735.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0735.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cf9f26fab3bbc76af663e922f8ccf4da465b1866/2000/CVE-2000-0735.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0735.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1b97942de7f8736fb9dac77c314951b8b2cd2867/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0735.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0735.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0735.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0885.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0884","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0884.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0732","title":"Jeremy Arnold Worm Webserver 1.0 URL 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Jeremy Arnold Worm Webserver 1.0 存在 URL 过长导致的拒绝服务漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可通过发送超长 URL 请求导致服务器资源耗尽或崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Worm Webserver 1.0 版本，攻击复杂度低、无需认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），主要影响可用性。攻击者只需发送超长 URL 即可触发拒绝服务，建议升级至修复版本或限制 URL 长度进行缓解。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0732"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:22Z","remediation":"Jeremy Arnold Worm Webserver 1.0 存在 URL 拒绝服务漏洞，攻击者可通过发送过长 URL 导致服务器崩溃。建议立即升级到 Worm Webserver 2.0 或更高版本，并配置 URL 长度限制参数。此类服务不应运行在公网，直接从受信网络访问控制端口。使用小型协议栈或网络应用程序防火墙过滤超长URL请求，降低服务暴露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q3/0111.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1626","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5149","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0732.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0732.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0732","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0732.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0732.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3846f10533f33b6add488388e63fdc90a48d6484/2000/CVE-2000-0732.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0732.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0a07da1560249b2b9027d6c5d908418017bb7740/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0732.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0732.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0732.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0884.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0884.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0883","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0883.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0731","title":"Worm HTTP Server 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Worm HTTP 服务器存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造包含 \"..\" (点点) 序列的 HTTP 请求路径，绕过 Web 根目录限制，遍历服务器文件系统读取任意敏感文件（如系统配置文件、源代码、密码文件等）。该漏洞源于 Worm HTTP 服务器对用户提交的路径参数缺乏规范化校验与边界检查，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，仅需向目标服务器发送包含目录遍历序列的 HTTP GET 请求即可实现任意文件读取。该漏洞影响 Worm HTTP 服务器相关版本，CVSS 评分 5.0 (AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:N/A:N)，属于中危信息泄露漏洞，攻击复杂度低、无需认证、仅影响机密性。攻击者可利用此漏洞获取服务器敏感配置、源代码或系统文件，进而辅助进一步渗透攻击。建议升级至修复版本或在 Web 服务器层面配置路径规范化与访问控制策略进行缓解。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0731"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:21Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至修复目录遍历漏洞的 Worm HTTP Server 修补版本（如 1.0.1 及以上），或迁移至 Apache/Nginx 等现代 Web 服务器。若无法升级，可在 Web 服务器前部署 WAF 规则拦截包含 ../ 等路径遍历字符的请求，同时配置 Web 服务器根目录限制（chroot/jail）限制文件系统访问范围，并禁用目录浏览功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q3/0111.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1535","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1626","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5148","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2